{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim, Grab, and Send 'Em Flying!\u00a0 Take control of a physics-based mechanical claw to grab and toss sushi at will\u2014or entirely by accident! Experience the hilarious unpredictability of physics as you &quot;skillfully&quot; fling your favorite dishes to secure your score.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/3b2025cb0b60b8a83a544f1c7533e7df.poster.avif?t=1774576506\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/3b2025cb0b60b8a83a544f1c7533e7df.webm?t=1774576506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/3b2025cb0b60b8a83a544f1c7533e7df.mp4?t=1774576506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill the Encyclopedia of Weird Sushi From groovy, dancing Salmon and exploding Tuna to Shiny Egg and Ginger that races backward on the belt, collect every bizarre dish that makes your stomach growl. Can you catch them all and become the ultimate Sushi Master?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/7ffc5f8dc51de0c2f42fc815c57a1563.poster.avif?t=1774576506\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/7ffc5f8dc51de0c2f42fc815c57a1563.webm?t=1774576506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/extras/7ffc5f8dc51de0c2f42fc815c57a1563.mp4?t=1774576506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v